      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-297615",
      ":question/problem": "In a national nutrition survey, $850$ students were asked about their breakfast habits and physical activity level. The results are shown in the table below.\n\n| Physical Activity Level | Eats Breakfast Daily | Does Not Eat Breakfast Daily | Total |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| Low | $95$ | $115$ | $210$ |\n| Moderate | $170$ | $120$ | $290$ |\n| High | $215$ | $135$ | $350$ |\n| **Total** | **$480$** | **$370$** | **$850$** |\n\nIf one of the $850$ students is selected at random, what is the probability that the student eats breakfast daily?"
